"""Exactly one reserved fixed-M0 CF3 tight-SCF E/g point; no optimizer or Hessian.

Linux/WSL execution only. The controller owns the shared immutable-deadline
ledger and reserves both SCF and gradient before spawning this worker.
Importing this module or --validate-only never imports a quantum backend.
